      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "当 $\\Delta x\\ne0$ 时，$\\frac{\\Delta w}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}-\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}$。",
